WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.360
Identify selected computer parts and practise basic keyboard use.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:10.885
A computer has parts that work together. A keyboard lets us type, a mouse helps point

00:00:10.885 --> 00:00:15.504
and select, a storage device keeps files and a power supply provides electricity.

00:00:16.367 --> 00:00:21.360
The curriculum highlights Tab, Caps Lock and the bottom letter row. We should use

00:00:21.360 --> 00:00:25.284
devices carefully and ask an adult before inserting or removing drives.

00:00:26.117 --> 00:00:31.066
With permission, identify Tab and Caps Lock on a keyboard and type three short words.
